<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Saks started as a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Saks started as a buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney initiated coverage of Saks Holdings Inc with a buy recommendation, according to a Smith Barney source.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up one to 34-3/4 in midday New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
</text>
